       Look  up  the  full  path of the directory entry specified by the value
       _c_o_o_k_i_e.  The cookie is an opaque identifier uniquely identifying a par‐
       ticular directory entry.  The buffer given is filled in with  the  full
       path of the directory entry.

       For llooookkuupp__ddccooookkiiee() to return successfully, the kernel must still hold
       a cookie reference to the directory entry.

