NNOOTTEESS
       llooookkuupp__ddccooookkiiee() is a special‐purpose system call, currently used  only
       by  the oopprrooffiillee(1) profiler.  It relies on a kernel driver to register
       cookies for directory entries.

       The path returned may be suffixed by the string " (deleted)" if the di‐
       rectory entry has been removed.

